Ísabella: no injury.$dq$, $dq$Check in with guardian after 48 hours.$dq$, $dq$guardian$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, ARRAY[]::text[], $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-06-27T11:53:28.111Z'::timestamptz, false, NULL, NULL, $dq$[{"by":"steve","at":"2026-07-08T10:03:35.941Z","text":"so far okay from Fjóla july 6 via Abler"},{"by":"steve","at":"2026-07-20T16:17:27.059Z","text":"SDS got a message from Fjóla 20/7 requesting that we set up some form of counseling for Kristinn. SDS emailed JP, ÞA - awaiting clarity on process. Altered severity to High from Medium."}]$dq$, $dq$closed$dq$),
('ec219dca-e9c3-5010-a5bb-b8734d865dde'::uuid, $dq$["equipment"]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$low$dq$, '2026-07-07'::date, '18:00'::time, '9a0b7ef4-e0cc-5ab7-84e3-104a59e051b4'::uuid, $dq$Fossvogur$dq$, '15f72153-65d1-584d-b21c-318d3ba08847'::uuid, $dq$Quest 1$dq$, $dq$Quest dismasted when forestay pin fell out. Black boat side-towed to shore. No other damage, no injury. Straightforward fix.$dq$, $dq$Egill, Ásgeir (Quest); Snorri (black boat)$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, ARRAY[]::text[], $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-08T10:01:52.451Z'::timestamptz, true, '2026-07-08T10:01:52.451Z'::timestamptz, NULL, NULL, $dq$closed$dq$),
('77c3a4e0-d05a-52b8-bfa2-d24841f9e902'::uuid, $dq$["other"]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$low$dq$, '2026-07-08'::date, '14:00'::time, 'f6588fcc-1a18-5d49-b2d8-a267aeedfcf1'::uuid, $dq$Við Álftanes$dq$, NULL, $dq$$dq$, $dq$Framhaldsnámskeið at Bessastaðir: one kid pushed another onto electric fence, contact was up to 5 seconds. Tears, no injury. Resolved between them but note that we're usually wet when out there & be wary of underlying health risks.$dq$, $dq$Ari, Baltasar$dq$, $dq$Henrik, ÁMJ$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, ARRAY[]::text[], $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-09T09:45:32.041Z'::timestamptz, true, '2026-07-09T09:46:00.695Z'::timestamptz, NULL, $dq$[{"by":"steve","at":"2026-07-24T09:56:29.322Z","text":"23/7 - student reported touching fence. SDS reiterated to instructor that fence needs to be off limits"}]$dq$, $dq$closed$dq$),
('cc955cf8-a2ba-577e-915f-b05f0678a440'::uuid, $dq$["other"]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$medium$dq$, '2026-07-23'::date, '15:00'::time, 'b01b0bb1-b2f3-5276-aea0-4be1186d18ab'::uuid, $dq$Naustavör$dq$, NULL, $dq$$dq$, $dq$Student, Eva O. offered information to HMDC about patterns of self-harm (cutting). No immediate danger or wounds that needed covering or treating. There had been prior discussions about mortality, other behaviors (spider eating). Contacted student's mother by phone. HMDC led conversation. She arrived soon after, took student home after second brief discussion. She was given information about BUGL and the contact information with assurances that we would like to have the student back. With the quick arrival of the parent, the student was not warned ahead of time that she had been contacted.$dq$, $dq$Eva O., HMDC$dq$, $dq$SDS$dq$, $dq$As above.$dq$, $dq$SDS will give written follow up to parent.$dq$, $dq$guardian$dq$, $dq$Alexandra 6998979$dq$, $dq$$dq$, ARRAY[]::text[], $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-24T09:44:09.022Z'::timestamptz, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, $dq$review$dq$),
('7eb6e347-c246-5322-85f1-a380d26aa4e9'::uuid, $dq$["nearMiss"]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$low$dq$, '2026-07-23'::date, '09:30'::time, 'b01b0bb1-b2f3-5276-aea0-4be1186d18ab'::uuid, $dq$Naustavör$dq$, NULL, $dq$$dq$, $dq$After warmup, student Valur was missing. Class went off to Kópavogshöfn on rowboats. He eventually turned up at the house and SDS shuttled him out to the fleet. Had contacted parent to see if he had gone home (per student report). He reported having been in the bathroom, then going by foot to the library to find the group, misunderstanding the day's destination. Timing strange: must have left while the rest of students, staff were still at the dock and waiting/looking for him in the house.$dq$, $dq$Valur Sigfús (week 6)$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$Parent contacted 2x: first inquiring, then confirming that he was found.$dq$, $dq$none$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, ARRAY[]::text[], $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-24T09:52:48.271Z'::timestamptz, true, '2026-07-24T09:52:48.271Z'::timestamptz, NULL, NULL, $dq$closed$dq$),
('d811c977-6cb8-578c-ab27-a0de4ce55a74'::uuid, $dq$["injury"]$dq$::jsonb, $dq$low$dq$, '2026-07-23'::date, '14:00'::time, 'f6588fcc-1a18-5d49-b2d8-a267aeedfcf1'::uuid, $dq$Við Álftanes$dq$, NULL, $dq$$dq$, $dq$Student  hit in head with rock when another was throwing seaweed at him. Local swelling.$dq$, $dq$Knútur, (?), [week 6]$dq$, $dq$HMDC$dq$, $dq$Ice$dq$, $dq$none$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, $dq$$dq$, ARRAY[]::text[], $dq$steve$dq$, '2026-07-24T09:54:48.007Z'::timestamptz, true, '2026-07-24T09:54:48.007Z'::timestamptz, NULL, NULL, $dq$closed$dq$);
